# HeyForm Directory Structure

Quick reference for navigating the HeyForm monorepo.

## Root Structure

```
myform/
├── .cursor/rules/        # Cursor IDE rules (.mdc)
├── packages/             # Monorepo packages (pnpm workspace)
│   ├── answer-utils/    # Form submission utilities
│   ├── embed/           # Embed JavaScript library
│   ├── form-renderer/   # Form rendering library
│   ├── server/          # NestJS backend
│   ├── shared-types-enums/  # Shared types/enums
│   ├── utils/           # Common utilities
│   └── webapp/          # React frontend
├── package.json         # Root config + workspace + overrides
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml  # pnpm workspace config
└── tsconfig.json        # Root TypeScript config
```

## Frontend (`packages/webapp`)

**Tech**: React 19, Vite, TypeScript, TailwindCSS, Apollo Client

```
webapp/src/
├── assets/              # SVG icons, images (48+ files)
├── components/          # Reusable UI components (37 files)
│   ├── Button.tsx
│   ├── Input.tsx
│   ├── Modal.tsx
│   └── ...
├── consts/              # Constants
│   ├── gql.ts          # GraphQL queries/mutations
│   └── ...
├── layouts/             # Layout components
│   ├── Auth/
│   ├── Form/
│   └── Workspace/
├── locales/             # i18n translations (7 languages)
├── pages/               # Route pages
│   ├── auth/           # Login, Signup
│   ├── form/           # Form pages
│   │   ├── Builder/   # Form builder (83 files) ⭐
│   │   ├── Analytics/
│   │   ├── Settings/
│   │   └── Submissions/
│   ├── project/
│   └── workspace/
├── routes/              # Route configuration
├── services/            # API services (GraphQL clients)
│   ├── form.ts
│   ├── auth.ts
│   └── ...
├── store/               # State management (Zustand/MobX)
├── styles/              # Global SCSS
├── utils/               # Utility functions
├── i18n.ts
└── main.tsx            # Entry point ⭐
```

**Key Locations**:
- Entry point: `src/main.tsx`
- Routes: `src/routes/index.ts`
- GraphQL queries: `src/consts/gql.ts`
- API services: `src/services/*.ts`
- Form builder: `src/pages/form/Builder/` (83 files)

## Backend (`packages/server`)

**Tech**: NestJS 7, GraphQL, MongoDB/Mongoose, Bull queues

```
server/src/
├── main.ts              # Entry point ⭐
├── app.module.ts        # Root module ⭐
├── common/              # Shared code
│   ├── decorator/      # Custom decorators (9 files)
│   ├── graphql/        # GraphQL schema (12 files) ⭐
│   ├── guard/          # Auth guards (7 files)
│   ├── filter/         # Exception filters
│   └── middleware/
├── config/              # Configuration modules
│   ├── mongo/
│   ├── redis/
│   ├── smtp/
│   └── upload/
├── controller/          # REST controllers (12 files)
│   ├── upload.controller.ts
│   └── ...
├── model/               # Mongoose models (28 files) ⭐
│   ├── form.model.ts
│   ├── user.model.ts
│   └── ...
├── resolver/            # GraphQL resolvers (86 files) ⭐
│   ├── auth/           # Auth resolvers (4)
│   ├── form/           # Form resolvers (22)
│   ├── submission/     # Submission resolvers (5)
│   └── user/           # User resolvers (10)
├── service/             # Business logic (23 files) ⭐
│   ├── form.service.ts
│   ├── auth.service.ts
│   └── ...
├── queue/               # Bull queue processors (7 files)
├── schedule/            # Scheduled tasks (4 files)
└── utils/               # Utilities (31 files)
```

**Key Locations**:
- Entry: `src/main.ts`
- Root module: `src/app.module.ts`
- GraphQL schemas: `src/common/graphql/*.graphql.ts`
- Resolvers: `src/resolver/` (organized by domain)
- Services: `src/service/` (business logic)
- Models: `src/model/` (database schemas)

